    "title": "Jon Bon Jovi Planning Farewell Tour After Vocal Cord Surgery: Singer's Voice is 'Finally Strong Enough' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Rob Shuter ,\n14 hours ago\nGetty Images Rock fans, get ready: Jon Bon Jovi has been working to rebuild his voice after vocal cord surgery, and insiders say the 63-year-old frontman is planning to put a blockbuster farewell tour in motion — with an announcement coming any day.\nGetty Images “Jon’s voice is finally strong enough to hit the road again,” says a music industry insider.\n“For a while, there were real fears he couldn’t do it. But he’s put in the work, and now he’s ready. Fans are going to lose their minds!” And a longtime associate assures: “He’s not going out half-strength. He’s going out on top.”",
